*> PLB-K009 browse-not-active: a CICS browse command for a file whose
*> browse has ended, or a second STARTBR while one is active.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BROWSE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-KEY              PIC X(11).
01  WS-REC              PIC X(300).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LINE.
    *> Reported: READNEXT after ENDBR; STARTBR while active.
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('ACCTDAT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS READNEXT FILE('ACCTDAT') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-KEY)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS ENDBR FILE('ACCTDAT') END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS READNEXT FILE('ACCTDAT') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-KEY)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('CUSTDAT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) END-EXEC.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-REC.
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('CUSTDAT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) END-EXEC.
    *> Not reported: a new STARTBR first, another file, a REQID, and
    *> a PERFORM between.
    EXEC CICS ENDBR FILE('CUSTDAT') END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('CUSTDAT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS READPREV FILE('CUSTDAT') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-KEY)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS ENDBR FILE('CUSTDAT') END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS READNEXT FILE('ACCTDAT') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-KEY)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('ACCTDAT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) REQID(1) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('ACCTDAT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) REQID(2) END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS ENDBR FILE('TRANSACT') END-EXEC
    PERFORM START-TRANSACT
    EXEC CICS READNEXT FILE('TRANSACT') INTO(WS-REC) RIDFLD(WS-KEY)
    END-EXEC
    EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
START-TRANSACT.
    EXEC CICS STARTBR FILE('TRANSACT') RIDFLD(WS-KEY) END-EXEC.
